    "phase_in_months": 0,
    "quote": "Manufacturers shall report every thermal incident involving overheating, smoke, fire, injury, or material property damage to the relevant regulator within 24 hours of learning of it, with a complete incident report within 10 business days. Manufacturers shall notify affected customers within 48 hours when an incident indicates a potential product safety risk, and promptly provide safety instructions. Suspected incidents shall be reported as such; updates may follow as facts are confirmed."
   },
